date-released: "2026-08-27"

authors:
  - family-names: "Solen"
    given-names: "Alyssa"

abstract: "A controlled AI Foundations test of whether a prior constraint can materially affect a later trajectory after the constraint is no longer operating when evidence of the prior decision remains externally observable and reachable across reset. Fresh post-reset activations are compared under evidence-blind and external-evidence conditions without carrying task-specific model state, prior transcript, or the original constraint across reset."

